                      (adybug/src/main.s):00753                 ; ldd ,y++ clobbers B, so use a Y-vs-sentinel loop instead of decb.
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00754                 ; See wiki/internal/implementation/lessons-learned.html
                      (adybug/src/main.s):00755                 ; §"LDD ,Y++ clobbers B".
