C321 10ACE4           (adybug/src/main.s):00764                 cmpy    ,s
C324 25EF             (adybug/src/main.s):00765                 blo     btrow
C326 3262             (adybug/src/main.s):00766                 leas    2,s
C328 35C0             (adybug/src/main.s):00767                 puls    u,pc
